red statistically significant at p≤0.05.\"}, {\"loc\": \"table 1\", \"q\": \"Estimates with CI widths >20 might not be reliable.\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"NIS-Teen methodology, including the weighting procedure, has been described previously.\"}], \"confidence\": \"medium\", \"uncertain_fields\": [\"study_design\"]}", "type": "text"}]}